### Bank Adapter API Examples

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Authorize Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bank/authorize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentId": "pay_1234567890",
  "providerId": "stripe_prod_001",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "metadata": {
    "orderId": "ord_123456",
    "customerId": "cust_123456"
  }
}

### 2. Capture Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bank/capture
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentId": "pay_1234567890",
  "providerId": "stripe_prod_001",
  "authorizationToken": "pi_1234567890_abcd1234",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "metadata": {
    "orderId": "ord_123456"
  }
}

### 3. Refund Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bank/refund
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentId": "pay_1234567890",
  "providerId": "stripe_prod_001",
  "authorizationToken": "pi_1234567890_abcd1234",
  "amount": 50.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "metadata": {
    "reason": "customer_request",
    "orderId": "ord_123456"
  }
}

### 4. Void Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bank/void
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentId": "pay_1234567890",
  "providerId": "stripe_prod_001",
  "authorizationToken": "pi_1234567890_abcd1234",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "metadata": {
    "orderId": "ord_123456"
  }
}

### 5. Check Provider Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bank/providers/stripe_prod_001/health

### 6. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 7. Get API Information
GET {{baseUrl}}/

###
